    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblins &amp; gun runnin`</strong> is a goofy slapstick top down shooter with rouge like, like gameplay. Your favourite cheese has been stolen by the pesky goblins so you must enter the belly of the beast and save your precious cheddar. Fight your way through the murky dungeons with fun goofy guns and interestingly weird characters.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblins &amp; gun runnin`</strong> is a goofy slapstick top down shooter with rouge like, like gameplay. Your favourite cheese has been stolen by the pesky goblins so you must enter the belly of the beast and save your precious cheddar. Fight your way through the murky dungeons with fun goofy guns and interestingly weird characters.</p>",
    "short_description": "Goblins &amp; Gun runnin` is a short rouge like like game where you venture down into a dungeon of goblins and other creatures to save your cheese. the dungeon is scalable to how you want to play. if you want to do a small run make the dungeon small or a big dungeon for long playthrough",
